   ],
   "lines": [
    "He listens with his head on one side. \"A preacher at the Jordan? Half the valley has walked past me for that man.\"",
    "\"Go on, then. I am not so hard a man as I look.\""
   ]
  },
  "bluff": {
   "effects": [
