      "command": "provoke"
     }
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    "He laughs, short and ugly. \"A soldier? Out here? You are a poor liar.\"",
    "His hand drops to his belt."
   ]
  },
  "yielded": {
   "lines": [
    "\"I yield! Take what you like. Only let me go.\""
